{%- comment -%}
  The home page. _layouts/base.html adds the nav at the top, and the closing band with the
  footer at the end. The copy is the approved copy deck (the Claude Doc "InTransit website copy
  deck"). Change the copy there first.

  The sections, from the top, with their backgrounds (see _sass/site/_page-home.scss):
    1 Hero (follows the appearance) · 2 Cities (tint) · 3 Live Activities (dark) ·
    4 Underground (plain) · 5 iPhone Duo (tint) · 6 Journey (plain) · 7 Travelogue (dark) ·
    8 Privacy (tint, glow) · 9 Pricing (plain) · Reviews (hidden until there are reviews) ·
    10 Help (the colour of the closing band).

  The images
    Each image is an artboard of the Website page in MTApp.sketch, exported to
    assets/images/home/ with the name of the artboard (see _includes/shot.html). The size of an
    artboard is the size of the image on the page at 1x.
{%- endcomment -%}

